{
 "_about": "Hand transcriptions of equations the official PDFs set in Cambria Math, which pdftotext renders as doubled math-italic glyphs. import_ccr.py swaps the garbled lines of each listed provision for this markup (see _swap_equation_lines). Each entry names the PDF page it was read from; `html` is display markup (plain HTML: span/var/sub/sup), `text` the same formula in plain text for copying. Letters and digits of every `text` were checked against the garbled glyph counts and the page image (Sprint 3, Oct 2026). Typos printed in the source (FuelRrate, hhr) are kept as printed and carry a [sic] marker.",
 "provisions": {
  "sec-gp12-III-F-3": {
